    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447490/extras/ddb338e74a852b6b3b6177f77c2cfae9.avif?t=1752822255\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather clues about your father's disappearance while uncovering dark family secrets. Each interaction reveals new layers of mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three beautiful women to interact with through a complete dialogue system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build bonds of trust or succumb to temptation with three unique women, each with their own hidden motives. Your decisions will affect not only your pleasures but your fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elaborate puzzle design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environment-based enigmas using logic, observation, and collected items. No random solutions - each puzzle has meaningful context.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple simultaneous objectives for you to progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions matter: Choose who to trust, which secrets to keep, and how far you'll go in search of the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic 3D environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing 3D character animations in all kinds of sexual fantasies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a meticulously crafted 1988 setting, filled with period-accurate details and growing psychological tension.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447490/extras/ddb338e74a852b6b3b6177f77c2cfae9.avif?t=1752822255\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather clues about your father's disappearance while uncovering dark family secrets. Each interaction reveals new layers of mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three beautiful women to interact with through a complete dialogue system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build bonds of trust or succumb to temptation with three unique women, each with their own hidden motives. Your decisions will affect not only your pleasures but your fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elaborate puzzle design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environment-based enigmas using logic, observation, and collected items. No random solutions - each puzzle has meaningful context.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple simultaneous objectives for you to progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions matter: Choose who to trust, which secrets to keep, and how far you'll go in search of the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic 3D environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing 3D character animations in all kinds of sexual fantasies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a meticulously crafted 1988 setting, filled with period-accurate details and growing psychological tension.</p></li></ul>",
